# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets --
#
# None of these are in the repository, and none of them can be: this project is
# public, and a signing key in a public history is the right for anyone to sign
# an update to the app people already have installed.
#
# Copy the .sample beside each one and fill it in. Without them a debug build
# still works, which is what keeps a fresh clone usable; a release build is
# unsigned, and push notifications are simply absent.
/keystore.properties
/signup.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
/app/google-services.json

# Gradle/IDE
.kotlin/
